{"response": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <title>Courthouse Filing Fees \u2014 March Retained Amount</title>\n  <style>\n    body {\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n      color: #222;\n      max-width: 900px;\n      margin: 40px auto;\n      padding: 0 20px;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n    h1, h2 {\n      color: #0f2d52;\n    }\n    .box {\n      background: #f6f8fb;\n      border: 1px solid #d9e2f0;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 16px 20px;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n    .answer {\n      background: #eef9f0;\n      border: 2px solid #4a9c5a;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 18px 20px;\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    table {\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      width: 100%;\n      margin: 16px 0;\n    }\n    th, td {\n      border: 1px solid #cfd8e3;\n      padding: 10px 12px;\n      text-align: right;\n    }\n    th:first-child, td:first-child {\n      text-align: left;\n    }\n    th {\n      background: #f1f5fa;\n    }\n    code {\n      background: #f4f4f4;\n      padding: 1px 4px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <h1>Retained Filing Fee Amount for March</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"box\">\n    <p><strong>We ignore the $9,400 passport-services revenue</strong> because the problem states it is handled separately and is <em>not</em> part of filing fee collections.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2>1. Compute base filing fees</h2>\n  <table>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>Case Type</th>\n        <th>Filings</th>\n        <th>Base Fee</th>\n        <th>Base Total</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Civil</td>\n        <td>420</td>\n        <td>$85</td>\n        <td>$35,700</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Family-law</td>\n        <td>175</td>\n        <td>$120</td>\n        <td>$21,000</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Probate</td>\n        <td>60</td>\n        <td>$210</td>\n        <td>$12,600</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td><strong>Total</strong></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td><strong>$69,300</strong></td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <h2>2. Add the 6% state surcharge</h2>\n  <p>\n    Total with surcharge:\n    <br>\n    <code>$69,300 \u00d7 1.06 = $73,458</code>\n  </p>\n\n  <h2>3. Compute electronic filing credits</h2>\n  <p>Each electronic filing gets a <strong>$5 credit</strong>.</p>\n\n  <table>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>Case Type</th>\n        <th>Electronic %</th>\n        <th>Electronic Filings</th>\n        <th>Credit per Filing</th>\n        <th>Total Credit</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Civil</td>\n        <td>70%</td>\n        <td>420 \u00d7 0.70 = 294</td>\n        <td>$5</td>\n        <td>$1,470</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Family-law</td>\n        <td>40%</td>\n        <td>175 \u00d7 0.40 = 70</td>\n        <td>$5</td>\n        <td>$350</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Probate</td>\n        <td>25%</td>\n        <td>60 \u00d7 0.25 = 15</td>\n        <td>$5</td>\n        <td>$75</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td><strong>Total</strong></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td><strong>379</strong></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td><strong>$1,895</strong></td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <h2>4. Find total filing fees actually collected</h2>\n  <p>\n    Collected total\n    <br>\n    <code>$73,458 - $1,895 = $71,563</code>\n  </p>\n\n  <h2>5. Find how much the courthouse retained</h2>\n  <p>\n    The courthouse keeps 82% of the collected total:\n    <br>\n    <code>$71,563 \u00d7 0.82 = $58,681.66</code>\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"answer\">\n    Final answer: <strong>$58,682</strong>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"}